plan_items.tests:
Pure tests of gitGuardEnv: the pairs append to an existing GIT_CONFIG_COUNT, and testers get no GitHub credentials.
Real-git test in a temp folder whose name has a space (the same pattern as workspace.test.ts), with a bare origin and a clone under the guard env:
- push to main is rejected;
- push to swarm/issue-1 succeeds;
- a force push and a deletion are rejected;
- a local core.hooksPath pre-push (husky-like) still runs and can veto the push.
Must pass on both the ubuntu and windows CI runners.
